The timeout is caused by the complete partitioning of 24x24 arrays (576 elements each, 4 arrays = 2304 registers) combined with deeply nested loops. I need to drastically simplify: remove complete partitioning, use cyclic partitioning with small factors, and keep only simple pipeline pragmas on innermost loops.

